  "narrative": "PapaAlfa-One uses a very simple, unencrypted communication subsystem and a straight-forward command processing system, while PapaAlfa-Two employs the fake TLS communication scheme to encrypt communication between the client and the admin channel and uses a more robust command processing system. Note that not all variants of hosts 127.0.0.1 TangoBravo overwrite all of the domains; specifically, alyac.co.kr, boho.or.kr, download.boho.or.kr, and ahnlab.com are not found in all samples. When activated without any command line arguments or with the command line argument , KiloAlfa activates its persistence functionality.",
